  "headline": "Tamil Nadu Files Supreme Court Review On Karthigai Deepam Lighting",
  "seoTitle": "Tamil Nadu Files Supreme Court Review On Karthigai Deepam",
  "metaDescription": "The Tamil Nadu government has filed a review plea in the Supreme Court regarding the Karthigai Deepam lighting at Thiruparankundram hill.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Tamil Nadu government submitted a review petition to the Supreme Court challenging an interim order concerning lamp lighting at Thiruparankundram.",
    "The Supreme Court had previously granted permission for a one-time Karthigai Deepam lighting event on the designated hill in Madurai.",
    "The legal challenge has prompted political criticism from the Bharatiya Janata Party, which characterized the government's opposition as anti-Hindu."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The legal dispute centers on the performance of the Karthigai Deepam festival lighting on the Thiruparankundram hill in Madurai. Following an interim order from the Supreme Court that allowed the ritual to proceed as a one-time event, the Tamil Nadu government initiated a formal review process to challenge the ruling. This decision has intensified the political climate in the state. The Bharatiya Janata Party has publicly criticized the move, with spokesperson Sudhanshu Trivedi describing the state government's legal opposition to the lighting as a display of hostility toward Hindu practices. The controversy highlights ongoing tensions regarding the regulation of religious observances in state-managed spaces and the balance of authority between judicial directives and governmental policy. Legal consultations were held by state officials prior to the filing of the review petition as the government seeks a re-evaluation of the court's earlier interim decision.",
